<title>CHINA: KARRIE ANNOUNCES FIRST FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>KARRIE ANNOUNCES FIRST FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 27.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  5.4</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	21.05 gain</p>
<p>    Net			  81.21</p>
<p>    Turnover		   598.62</p>
<p>    Company name	     Karrie International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		September 9-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 September 19</p>
<p>NOTE - Computer casing manufacturer Karrie International was listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on December 16, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$5.84 million on write back on amounts due from related companies, gain of HK$9.52 million on disposal of a property and gain of HK$5.69 million on application monies received on issue of new shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
